  "notes": [
    "The PDF holds two overlapping versions of the end of the list. Page 2 runs from \"Melancolico, Nelson\" to \"Yrastorza, Raphael Sr.\" and ends with its own Total (510,129.40; less than 30 days (88,300.00), partly overprinted by the \"Page 2 of 3\" footer). Page 3 (signed, stamped received by Accounting 02-20-2020) repeats the list from \"Sayson, Lorgena\" onward with extra rows (Taga-an, Tampus Elsie, Tejano, Tesaluna, Teves, Tongco, Ymbong) and a Total of 510,123.45. Table \"main\" = page 1 + page 2 up to \"Salvado, Ma. Cecilia\" + page 3, with the page 3 Total; table \"page2Ending\" keeps the superseded page 2 rows from \"Sayson, Lorgena\" onward and the page 2 Total. Both versions reconcile in their aging columns; in table main the item amounts sum to 510,129.40, 5.95 more than the printed total 510,123.45, because the printed total includes Tongco, Mayflor S.'s (5.95) whose Amount Balance cell is blank on the page (kept null).",
    "\"Tongco, Mayflor S.\" has a blank Amount Balance but (5.95) under \"Less than 30 days\"; the page 3 Amount Balance total (510,123.45) is 5.95 lower than page 2's, so the total includes it. Rows printed with \"-\" balances are kept as 0.",
    "Each item row otherwise has the balance repeated in exactly one aging column. Date Granted is printed as month-year and kept as text; \"Caras, Ma. Leny\" (184,000.00) has no date or purpose.",
    "summary.count counts the rows of table \"main\", including the seven rows with a zero or blank balance."
